# Retail Sales Analytics & Customer Intelligence Pipeline

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates an end-to-end retail data analytics pipeline using **PySpark, Databricks, Delta Lake, and Databricks AI/BI Dashboards**.

The project processes retail customer, product, store, order, order-item, and payment data. It applies data cleaning, joins, aggregations, window functions, statistical analysis, and denormalization to generate analytics-ready datasets for business reporting.

## 🎯 Business Objectives

- Analyze total sales revenue and units sold.
- Identify top-performing products and categories.
- Compare sales performance across stores and months.
- Understand customer spending patterns and membership segments.
- Analyze delivered, cancelled, and pending orders.
- Build an interactive analytics dashboard in Databricks.

